WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:06.320
In the name of the Father and of the Son and of the Holy Spirit, Amen.

00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:14.440
The reading from the Sinaxadion, for September 8th, on which we commemorate the nativity

00:00:14.440 --> 00:00:17.800
of the Theotokos.

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:23.080
On the 8th of the month we celebrate the nativity of our sovereign lady, the most holy mother

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:27.200
of God and ever virgin Mary.

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:34.200
One was made by God and placed in paradise that his soul care might be to bring forth

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:40.760
good fruit and to contemplate God, his Creator, through his works.

00:00:40.760 --> 00:00:47.200
But Adam was driven out of the garden of delights, through the envy of the devil, who

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:53.040
deceived Eve, the first woman, and caused Adam to sin.

00:00:53.120 --> 00:01:02.840
Later, God gave the law to men by Moses and made known his will by the prophets in preparation

00:01:02.840 --> 00:01:10.120
for the greater blessing of the incarnation of his only Son, the Word of God, who would

00:01:10.120 --> 00:01:13.600
deliver us from the nets of the evil one.

00:01:13.600 --> 00:01:21.840
In taking our nature upon himself, Christ wished to share fully our fallen state, but without

00:01:21.840 --> 00:01:23.600
sin.

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:29.080
For he alone is without sin, being the Son of God.

00:01:29.080 --> 00:01:36.040
For this reason, he prepared for himself a spotless habitation, an immaculate ark, the

00:01:36.040 --> 00:01:43.640
most holy virgin Mary, who, although she too was subject to death and the condemnation of

00:01:43.640 --> 00:01:51.800
our first parents, yet she was chosen by God before all ages to be the new Eve.

00:01:51.800 --> 00:02:00.160
The mother of Christ, the Savior, the wellspring of our redemption and the archetype of all Christian

00:02:00.160 --> 00:02:03.080
holiness.

00:02:03.080 --> 00:02:09.280
On her father's side, the most holy virgin Mary, was of the royal line of David, through

00:02:09.280 --> 00:02:19.200
his son Nathan, who begot Levi, who begot Melkai, and Panther, who begot Bar Panther, who

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:24.360
begot Joachim, who was the father of the mother of God.

00:02:24.360 --> 00:02:32.840
Anna, the wife of Joachim, was also of David's lineage, for she was the granddaughter of Matha,

00:02:32.840 --> 00:02:37.480
who was himself the grandson of David through Solomon.

00:02:37.480 --> 00:02:45.920
Matha married a certain Mary of the tribe of Judah, and they had a son named Jacob, the father

00:02:45.960 --> 00:02:54.400
of Joseph, the carpenter, and three daughters, Mary, Sylvia, and Anna.

00:02:54.400 --> 00:03:02.160
Mary gave birth to Salome, the midwife, Sylvia to Elizabeth, the mother of the forerunner,

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:06.480
and Anna to the mother of God.

00:03:06.480 --> 00:03:13.160
God in his wisdom showed the Baroness of human nature before the coming of Christ, by leaving

00:03:13.200 --> 00:03:19.200
Joachim and Anna, childless, until they were very old.

00:03:19.200 --> 00:03:26.840
Joachim, who was both rich and devout, prayed without ceasing, and offered gifts to God,

00:03:26.840 --> 00:03:33.840
that he would deliver his wife and himself from their reproach among men.

00:03:33.840 --> 00:03:40.400
One feastay, he had gone to the temple to present his offering, when one of the congregation

00:03:40.480 --> 00:03:49.480
of the tribe of Ruben turned to him and said, You are not allowed to offer with us, because

00:03:49.480 --> 00:03:52.320
you have no child.

00:03:52.320 --> 00:04:00.360
These words cut Joachim to the heart, and instead of returning home, he went up into a mountain

00:04:00.360 --> 00:04:09.320
alone to pray and weep, while at the same hour Anna too was shedding abundant tears and

00:04:09.400 --> 00:04:12.360
fervently imploring heaven.

00:04:12.360 --> 00:04:20.200
Our God who is rich in mercy and full of compassion, heard their entreaties, and sent the messenger

00:04:20.200 --> 00:04:27.240
of His benevolence and herald our salvation, the archangel Gabriel to Anna.

00:04:27.240 --> 00:04:34.880
He announced that she would conceive in her old age and bear a child, who would be the

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:42.360
praise of the whole earth, full of joy and amazement, she exclaimed, As the Lord my God

00:04:42.360 --> 00:04:50.560
lives, whether the child I bear be a son or a daughter, I will consecrate it to the Lord

00:04:50.560 --> 00:04:56.520
my God to serve him all the days of his life.

00:04:56.520 --> 00:05:04.240
Joachim too was visited by an angel and told to lead his flocks homeward and to rejoice with

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:13.760
his wife and all their house, because God had determined to put an end to their reproach.

00:05:13.760 --> 00:05:21.880
When nine months had passed, Anna gave birth and asked the midwife, whom have I brought into

00:05:21.880 --> 00:05:23.880
the world?

00:05:23.880 --> 00:05:32.560
A daughter she replied, My soul has been magnified this day, exclaimed Anna, and gently

00:05:32.560 --> 00:05:35.120
laid the child down.

00:05:35.120 --> 00:05:43.360
And when the days of her purification according to the law were accomplished, she arose, washed,

00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:51.080
gave suck to the child and called her Mary, the name obscurally awaited by the patriarchs,

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:57.920
the prophets and the righteous and by which God would reveal the mystery hidden from all

00:05:57.920 --> 00:05:59.680
eternity.

00:05:59.680 --> 00:06:06.240
The child grew strong and her mother placed her on the ground when she was six months old

00:06:06.240 --> 00:06:09.520
to see if she would stand up.

00:06:09.520 --> 00:06:18.080
Confidently, Mary took seven paces and then turned back and clung to her mother's breast.

00:06:18.080 --> 00:06:27.600
Anna lifted her up, saying, As the Lord my God lives, you shall tread on the ground no more

00:06:27.600 --> 00:06:32.840
until I take you into the temple of the Lord.

00:06:32.840 --> 00:06:40.080
Her mother kept the room where the child was as a holy place, and no unlovely or unclean

00:06:40.080 --> 00:06:47.400
thing entered there, and she brought daughters of Hebrews of pure lineage to play with

00:06:47.400 --> 00:06:49.480
the child.

00:06:49.480 --> 00:06:55.040
When the child was one year old, Joachim gave a great feast.

00:06:55.040 --> 00:07:01.760
He invited the priests, the scribes, and all the counsel and people of Israel.

00:07:01.760 --> 00:07:08.880
He presented Mary to the priests, and they blessed her, saying, God of our fathers blessed

00:07:08.880 --> 00:07:16.480
this child, and give her an everlasting name to be named of all generations.

00:07:16.480 --> 00:07:24.240
And all the people responded, Let it be so, let it be so, Amen.

00:07:24.240 --> 00:07:33.520
Joachim also presented her to the high priest, who blessed her, saying, God of infinite majesty

00:07:33.520 --> 00:07:43.720
looked down upon this little child and grant her a blessing, supreme and beyond compare.

00:07:43.720 --> 00:07:51.080
Then her mother carried Mary into the holy place kept for her, and gave her the breast, singing

00:07:51.160 --> 00:07:54.120
to the Lord this hymn.

00:07:54.120 --> 00:08:02.480
I will sing to the Lord my God, for he has visited me, and taken away the reproach of my enemies,

00:08:02.480 --> 00:08:12.360
for the Lord has given me the fruit of his righteousness, at once simple and multiple, in its operation.

00:08:12.360 --> 00:08:19.000
Who will now tell it to the sons of Rubin that Anna is a mother?

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:26.680
Learn, learn you twelve tribes of Israel that Anna is a mother.

00:08:26.680 --> 00:08:35.480
Then she left the child in the holy place, reserved for her, and went out to serve the guests,

00:08:35.480 --> 00:08:41.280
who rejoiced and praised the God of Israel.

00:08:41.280 --> 00:08:48.320
Through the prayers of our Holy Father's, O Lord Jesus Christ our God, have mercy on us

00:08:48.320 --> 00:08:49.480
and save us.
